  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1729533442_1007663_b5f27403181651fb070faa0c07e04b2e.png",
  "description": "<h3 class=\"image-bar__caption\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>Adapting containers for life.&trade;<br><br>Conex conversions made easy.</h3>\r\n<div class=\"faqsitems__text--small rte-setting text-center\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>Converting your shipping container into a workshop, office, storefront, or living space?<br><br>The challenge is the corrugated surface does not fit off-the-shelf components designed for home construction. That's why Container Creations&trade; makes patented adapters to bring your vision to life.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">--</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>AdaptAIR&trade; is an easy-to-install, epoxy-coated steel adapter for adding ventilation to the corrugated roof of your shipping container.</strong><strong></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>AdaptAIR&trade; will fit any turbine with a 12-inch collar (Whirlybird turbine, solar powered turbine, or static vent) which can be found online or at your local hardware store.</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Container ventilation is critical to reduce high temperatures and avoid condensation known as \"container rain,\" which can cause damage to your stored items.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Each vent&nbsp;includes an installation kit:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n<li>Step-by-step photo instructions</li>\r\n<li>(2) drill bits</li>\r\n<li>(1) driver bit</li>\r\n<li>(30) screws</li>\r\n<li>Abrasive pad</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">--</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>PRECISE DESIGN</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>&bull; Only product designed for standard 3.5\" ribbing on Conex shipping container roof corrugation. Please refer to our measurement chart.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>DO-IT-YOURSELF</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>&bull; Includes complete installation kit and instructions for easy installation.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>GUARANTEED FIT</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>&bull; No hassle guarantee on fit or quality. Molded with tight tolerances to match your container roof corrugation.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>MASSIVE AIRFLOW</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>&bull; Add any full size 12-inch turbine vent, static vent, or solar powered vent.&nbsp;ALL sold separately.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>MOLDED STEEL</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>&bull; One piece stamped steel coated in gray epoxy for a lifetime guarantee.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>EPOXY COATING</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>&bull;&nbsp;Durable industrial grade coating far exceeds the coating used on shipping containers.&nbsp;Epoxy can&nbsp;be coated with any roof paint or coating.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>GUARANTEED FOR THE LIFE OF YOUR CONTAINER</strong></p>",
